    When a later merge-review disposition lands with verdict class "merge_review_caught"
    Then two label records should exist for the task
    And the earlier label record should be unchanged
    And the records should be readable in the order they were written

  # Why: Just-outside enum boundary — the four-class taxonomy is closed; unknown classes must not corrupt the dataset
  @task:TASK-LBL-001
  @boundary @negative
  Scenario: A disposition with an unrecognised verdict class is rejected
